# AI backend for reading-level explanations and "Ask about this verse".
# All other features work without this. See the README for details.

# --- Recommended: the bundled serverless proxy (api/complete.js) -----------
# Set this in your Vercel project's Environment Variables (Server, not exposed
# to the browser). The client calls /api/complete, which reads this key.
# Get one at https://console.anthropic.com/.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Optional: model the proxy uses. Defaults to claude-opus-4-8.
# Use claude-haiku-4-5 for a cheaper, faster option.
ANTHROPIC_MODEL=

# --- Advanced alternative: point the client at a custom endpoint ----------
# Only needed if you are NOT using the bundled /api/complete proxy.
# VITE_* vars are bundled into the client, so a key set here is public — use a
# server-side proxy for anything public.
VITE_AI_ENDPOINT=
VITE_AI_API_KEY=
VITE_AI_MODEL=
